OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FDry start, with bright or sunny
OL,6,Fspells. Cloud thickens late morning,
OL,7,Fwith outbreaks of rain soon arriving
OL,8,Ffrom the southwest by early afternoon.
OL,9,FThe rain becomes becoming persistent
OL,10,Fand often heavy through the afternoon.
OL,11,FTemperatures slightly above average.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FHeavy rain this evening for
OL,14,Fmany places. Overnight the rain
OL,15,Fgradually becomes light and then
OL,16,Fmostly dies away, leaving dry and
OL,17,Flargely cloudy conditions.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
