OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CSunday:FLargely dry and cloudy at
OL,6,Ffirst. Bright or sunny spells develop,
OL,7,Falong with scattered showers, which
OL,8,Fbecome often heavy and thundery, then
OL,9,Fmore widespread late afternoon and
OL,10,Fevening.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FMonday
OL,13,Fand Tuesday bright or sunny spells and
OL,14,Fscattered showers, sometimes heavy and
OL,15,Fthundery. Also breezy Monday.
OL,16,FWednesday becoming breezy with heavy
OL,17,Frain arriving. Temperatures around
OL,18,Fnormal.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
